' timing: CommandTimeMessage, CommandConstraint, CommandAtTime
@startuml
robust "Web Browser" as WB
concise "Web User" as WU
@0 as :start
WU is Idle
WB is Idle
@100
WU -> WB : URL
WU@100 <-> @+150 : {150 ms}
@:start+300
WB is Waiting
WB@:start -[#red]> WU@:start+300 : back
@200 <-> @:start+250
@enduml
